(7510394, 1197675, 28742, '<td valign="top">I''m somewhat baffled at the low scores. I assume it''s all about the subject matter. The technical excellence on this should have started the bidding at 5.<br/>Obviously (hopefully) this is someone you know - family or friend. I''m out of the loop on it if there is a loop, but my thoughts &amp; prayers are with everyone involved.</td>', 'I''m somewhat baffled at the low scores. I assume it''s all about the subject matter. The technical excellence on this should have started the bidding at 5.Obviously (hopefully) this is someone you know - family or friend. I''m out of the loop on it if there is a loop, but my thoughts & prayers are with everyone involved.', '2017-04-23 06:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7555941, 1197617, 185792, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> From a depth of field standpoint, I could not have captured a sharp image of the head in the blurred puddle foreground surrounded by blur and the body in sharp focus.  Interested to know how you focused this.  Maybe it''s a combination of two images with different focus points? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>this is a single image .</td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23: From a depth of field standpoint, I could not have captured a sharp image of the head in the blurred puddle foreground surrounded by blur and the body in sharp focus.  Interested to know how you focused this.  Maybe it''s a combination of two images with different focus points?   this is a single image .', '2018-01-29 10:22:36.000000', NULL, 0);
